  "generationId": "01a1e633-f6cf-78aa-9f4a-e86499275a74",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-104/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.654467
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I received your letter.",
      "path": "audio/1970-104/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.111224,
      "end": 3.374422
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "So many questions!",
      "path": "audio/1970-104/03.mp3",
      "start": 4.763764,
      "end": 6.176553
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "To answer them I would have to write a book bigger than the Mahabharata!",
      "path": "audio/1970-104/04.mp3",
      "start": 7.584739,
      "end": 11.495759999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "But even then you would not get your answers because some questions others can never answer - your answers lie deep within your own life.",
      "path": "audio/1970-104/05.mp3",
      "start": 13.040385,
      "end": 20.221383
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "And some questions have no answers because they are wrong questions for which no answers can be found.",
      "path": "audio/1970-104/06.mp3",
      "start": 21.931926999999998,
      "end": 27.802812
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "As the search continues these questions always gradually drop away.",
      "path": "audio/1970-104/07.mp3",
      "start": 29.371066,
      "end": 33.821518999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Then there are some questions which are right questions but have no answers at all.",
      "path": "audio/1970-104/08.mp3",
      "start": 35.53195,
      "end": 39.953922999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "They have to be experienced deep within oneself.",
      "path": "audio/1970-104/09.mp3",
      "start": 41.453175,
      "end": 44.75
    }
  ]
}
